    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0963" n="933" xml:id="pg933"/>

                <head>358. Telegram From the Department of State to the Mission of the European
                    Office of the United Nations<anchor n="1" xml:id="d358-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1967-05-15T19:03:00-04:00">May 15, 1967, 7:03 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p>194633. Personal from the President for Ambassador Roth. Francis has just
                    reported to me that we have a Kennedy Round bargain. I want you to know what a
                    first-rate job you, Mike and your team have done, and how much I appreciate it.
                    Congratulations. I look forward to your report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Rusk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d358-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d358-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Eyes Only Reels. Secret; Flash; Limdis/Potatoes.
                    Text received from the White House, and approved by Roger Morris (S/S-S).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
